### Test Users API Endpoints

### 1. Get All Users
GET https://localhost:7237/api/Users
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get User By ID
GET https://localhost:7237/api/Users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Create New User
POST https://localhost:7237/api/Users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

###

### 4. Update User
PUT https://localhost:7237/api/Users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "updated@example.com",
  "fullName": "Updated Name"
}

###

### 5. Delete User
DELETE https://localhost:7237/api/Users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

###

### Test Validation - Create User with Missing Fields
POST https://localhost:7237/api/Users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Test Validation - Invalid Email Format
POST https://localhost:7237/api/Users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "validuser",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

###
